    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Prohibits sending unsolicited sexual messages to minors.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(a) the sender uses a carriage service to transmit a communication to another person (the recipient); and (b) the sender does this with the intention of making it easier to procure a person (the child) to engage in sexual activity with the sender; and (c) the child is someone who is, or who the sender believes to be, under 16 years of age;";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "(1) A person (the sender) commits an offence if:...";
