    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Court must consider age and maturity of the person in relation to whom the offence was committed.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(1) In determining the sentence to be passed, or the order to be made, respect of a person for an offence against this Subdivision, the court must take into account the following matters:";
